	(descr "Lumberg 1502 03, 3.5mm mono (TS) jack with tip break contact (normalling), vertical/upright, THT, M6x0.5 threaded bushing (4mm) + Ø8 collar for panel mounting with nut, PCB-to-panel 10mm, body 9 x 10.5 x 9mm (Eurorack/Thonkiconn style). Drawn from Lumberg datasheet 1502_03 (07/2025) and the Lumberg STEP; solder eyes 0.3 x 1.3 through the board — slots 0.6 x 1.6 (sheet recommends 0.5 x 1.5). Origin = plug axis. Lumberg pins: 1=S 2=T 3=T break contact. Farnell 1270966.")
